{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":57,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܐܲܠܬܲܫܚܸܬ. ܡܸܟ݂ܬܵܡ ܕܕܘܝܕ، ܐܝܡܢ ܕܥܪܝܩ ܠܗ ܡ̣ܢ ܩܕܡ ܫܐܘܠܔ ܠܓܘ ܓܦܝܬ‌ܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܪܲܚܸܡ ܥܲܠܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܪܲܚܸܡ ܥܲܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܒܝܼܘܼܟ݂ ܒܸܫܩܵܠܵܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ ܓܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܛܸܠܵܢܝܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܓܘܼܠܦܵܢܘܼ̈ܟ݂ ܒܸܬ ܫܵܩܠܹܢ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܠܔ ܕܥܵܒ݂ܪܝܼ ܐܘܼܠܨܵܢܹ̈ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܩܵܪܹܝܢ ܠܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܥܸܠܵܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܟܹܐ ܬܲܡܸܡ ܟܠܔ ܡܸܢܕܝܼ ܩܵܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܫܲܕܸܪ ܡ̣ܢ ܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܘܦܲܪܸܩ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܠܵܐܹܡ ܠܗ̇ܘ ܕܝܼܠܹܗ ܛܲܚܛܘܼܚܹܐ ܠܝܼ، ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܫܲܕܸܪ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܹܗ ܘܫܲܪܝܼܪܘܼܬܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܓܵܢܝܼ ܓܵܘܵܐ ܕܐܲܪ̈ܝܹܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܕܵܡܟܹܢ ܓܵܘܵܐ ܕܢܘܼܪܹ̈ܐ ܠܵܗܝܵܢܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܢܲܝ̈ܢܵܫܵܐ ܕܟܹܟܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܪܘܼܡܚܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܘܓܹܐܪܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܸܫܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܣܲܝܦܵܐ ܚܲܪܝܼܦܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܘܼܡ ܥܲܠܔ ܫܡܲܝܵܐ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܟܠܵܗ̇ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܗܵܘܹܐ ܐܝܼܩܵܪܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܓܲܪܕܵܐ ܗܘܼܕܸܪܗܘܿܢ ܠܦܵܣܘܿܥܝܵܬ‌ܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܝܼܦ ܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܦܝܼܪܗܘܿܢ ܓܘܼܒܵܐ ܒܐܘܼܪܚܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܒܓܵܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܢܦܝܼܠܔ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܒܓܵܘܹܗ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܩܵܘܝܵܢܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܠܸܒܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܡܩܵܘܝܵܢܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܠܸܒܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܫܲܒܚܸܢ ܘܒܸܬ ܙܵܡܪܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܥܘܿܫܝ، ܝܵܐ ܓܵܢܝܼ! ܪܥܘܿܫܝ، ܩܝܼܬܵܪܵܐ ܘܟܸܢܵܪܵܐ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܡܲܪܥܸܫܸܢ ܠܨܲܦܪܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܫܲܟܪܸܢܘܼܟ݂ ܓܵܘ ܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܙܵܡܪܹܢ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂ ܓܵܘ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܓܘܼܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܗܲܠܔ ܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܗܲܠܔ ܥܢܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܫܲܪܝܼܪܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܘܼܡ ܥܲܠܔ ܫܡܲܝܵܐ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܟܠܵܗ̇ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܗܵܘܹܐ ܐܝܼܩܵܪܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/57.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/58.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/56.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}